WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Choose a matching release
Download the APK and firmware for your exact board. Read the release notes and back up files you need.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Flash from a computer
Use the public web flasher in desktop Chrome or Edge with a USB data cable. Confirm board and version before starting.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Connect the Android app
Install the APK. Connect via USB host / OTG, grant USB access and enter Brucia companion mode on the device.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Check the first reply
Confirm device and firmware information. List files or request device info. No reply? Check cable, permission, mode and serial-port ownership.
